1
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:05,410
Watch who dares touch me. I'm carrying a Jiang heir

2
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:11,280
This is your grandson. You'd let him end up out there?

3
00:00:12,620 --> 00:00:17,430
Stop lying. At your age, how could you possibly be pregnant?

4
00:00:17,430 --> 00:00:23,200
We're at a hospital. Would I lie? Mom, son, please

5
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:27,592
I'm ruined, but this child is the Jiang family's only heir!

6
00:00:27,592 --> 00:00:31,972
Past life, my husband and his mistress had an affair... and killed me

7
00:00:31,972 --> 00:00:34,722
This life, your whole family pays in blood

8
00:00:34,722 --> 00:00:39,092
Xiao Lan, come wash my feet. Zhang Guifang

9
00:00:39,092 --> 00:00:43,232
Don't push it. Oh, my precious son says

10
00:00:43,232 --> 00:00:47,922
he wants grandma serving him herself. If she doesn't do it well

11
00:00:47,922 --> 00:00:52,642
he stays in there. All of us just wait, see who cracks first

12
00:00:52,642 --> 00:00:53,512
Honey

13
00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:57,950
Honey, calm down. Careful of the baby

14
00:00:57,950 --> 00:01:04,740
You're only spared because you carry a Jiang heir. Keep sweeping... Something's wrong

15
00:01:12,090 --> 00:01:17,750
Very wrong. The way Jiang Chengao looked... that's not how you look at a daughter-in-law

16
00:01:21,780 --> 00:01:26,790
Gently. I'm carrying your child. Don't crush it

